WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:05.000
Every video has a voice. Help more people understand it.

00:05.200 --> 00:11.000
Meet TranslatedSubs. Add a video link or a local file, then choose a target language.

00:11.200 --> 00:19.000
Watch speech become a transcript, then translated subtitles, with progress you can follow.

00:19.200 --> 00:27.000
Preview the video. Refine the words and timing right beside the picture.

00:27.200 --> 00:35.000
Download subtitles, choose soft or burned-in captions, and connect the same workflow to your tools through MCP.

00:35.200 --> 00:40.000
TranslatedSubs. Take your story further. Start translating.
